       super(name);
       this.vertex1 = vertex1;
       this.vertex2 = vertex2;
       this.vertex3 = vertex3;
   }
   ```
   El constructor recibe cuatro parámetros: `name`, `vertex1`, `vertex2` y `vertex3`. Llama al constructor de la clase base `Figure` usando `super(name)`.

3. **Método `area`**:
   ```java
   @Override
   public double area() {
       double Ax = vertex1.getX();
       double Ay = vertex1.getY();
       double Bx = vertex2.getX();
       double By = vertex2.getY();
       double Cx = vertex3.getX();
