package Session6;

public class Rectangle extends Quadrilateral {
    public Rectangle(String name, Point v1, Point v2, Point v3, Point v4) throws Exception {
        super(name, v1, v2, v3, v4);
        if (!isRegular()) {
            throw new Exception("The provided points do not form a rectangle.");
        }
    }

    @Override
    public double area() {
        Point nearest1 = getV1().nearest(new Point[]{getV2(), getV3(), getV4()});
        Point nearest2 = getV1().nearest(new Point[]{getV2(), getV3(), getV4()});
        return getV1().distance(nearest1) * getV1().distance(nearest2);
    }

    @Override
    public String toString() {
        return super.toString();
    }
}
```

- **Constructor**: The constructor of the `Rectangle` class calls the constructor of the `Quadrilateral` class using `super(name, v1, v2, v3, v4)` to initialize the `name` attribute.
