Your code for finding the maximum value in an array is correct. However, there is a small improvement that can be made to the loop initialization. Instead of starting the loop from `i=0`, you can start from `i=1` since you have already assigned `numbers[0]` to `biggest`.

Here is the improved version of your code:

```java
package recursion;

public class ArrayUtils {
