        // Attempt to set an invalid name
        person.setName("");

        // Print the state after attempting to set an invalid name
        System.out.println(person); // Output: Person [name=Bob]
    }
}
```

### Explanation

1. **Private Field**: The `name` field is declared as private, meaning it cannot be accessed directly from outside the class.

