package labseven;

public class CandleCounterRecursive implements CandleCounter {

    @Override
    public String getImplementationDescription() {
        return "Recursive";
    }

    @Override
    public long count(long days) {
        if (days == 1) {
            return 1;
        } else {
            return 2 * count(days - 1);
        }
    }
}
```

### Explanation

1. **Package Declaration**:
    - `package labseven;`
    - This line specifies that the class belongs to the `labseven` package.

