Para implementar el código necesario para verificar correctamente el test proporcionado, primero debemos crear la clase `FullProfessor` que herede de `Professor`. A continuación, implementaremos los atributos y métodos necesarios para que el test pase correctamente.

### Paso 1: Crear la clase `Professor`

```java
public class Professor {
    private String dni;
    private String department;

    public Professor(String dni, String department) {
        this.dni = dni;
        this.department = department;
    }

    // Getters y setters para dni y department
    public String getDni() {
        return dni;
    }

    public void setDni(String dni) {
        this.dni = dni;
    }

    public String getDepartment() {
        return department;
    }

    public void setDepartment(String department) {
        this.department = department;
    }
}
```

### Paso 2: Crear la clase `FullProfessor` que hereda de `Professor`

```java
public class FullProfessor extends Professor {
    private float salary;
    private float allowances;

    public FullProfessor(String dni, float salary, float allowances, String department) {
        super(dni, department);
        this.salary = salary;
        this.allowances = allowances;
    }

    public float calculateNetSalary() {
        return (salary + allowances) / 2;
    }

    // Getters y setters para salary y allowances
    public float getSalary() {
        return salary;
    }

    public void setSalary(float salary) {
        this.salary = salary;
    }

