### Clase `Point`

Asegúrate de que la clase `Point` esté definida correctamente en el mismo paquete `Session1`:

```java
package Session1;

public class Point {
    private double x;
    private double y;

    public Point(double x, double y) {
        this.x = x;
        this.y = y;
    }

    @Override
    public String toString() {
        return "(" + x + ", " + y + ")";
    }

    public double getX() {
        return x;
    }

    public double getY() {
        return y;
    }

    public double distance() {
        return Math.sqrt(x * x + y * y);
    }

    public double distance(Point anotherPoint) {
        double dx = x - anotherPoint.getX();
        double dy = y - anotherPoint.getY();
        return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
    }
}
```

