3. `decToBin(2, "10")` llama a `decToBin(1, "010")`
4. `decToBin(1, "010")` llama a `decToBin(0, "1010")`
5. `decToBin(0, "1010")` devuelve "1010"

Por lo tanto, el valor de retorno es "1010".

